    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) is proud to announce yet another significant achievement, this time by its Internal Audit Department (IAD). In a recent competition organized by the Institute of Internal Auditors - Kenya Chapter, aimed at recognizing outstanding Internal Audit functions, AKU's IAD stood out among a pool of competitive contenders.",
